{"version":1,"key":"card:387","content":{"id":387,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84a2716a-4515-44d6-87ff-9cd0147ffd54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"俞敏洪在北大的一次演讲，话题是因思想而光滑，新时代新思想。俞敏洪在此次演讲中指出的一些问题和提出的一些观点富有见解，因此特意记录下来。"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"3944f529-118f-48f7-83f7-7e0abc6dd24c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6406dad4-c0f3-41e6-8272-834851da2040","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"427bcaae-50e9-44aa-b60b-4c0cce784746","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"思想需要进一步的解放"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03c0976a-d180-4127-bb1b-f235a6e5b299","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前我们的思想被限制在一条管道中前行，思想不能突破这条管道，我们的讨论应该再大胆一点。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bbfa3a8a-019c-4007-8508-18eb0204f512","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8011d733-e7d0-4c79-8ed7-09421e22dc63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中国的体制没有鼓励真正的人才流动"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88820ae2-981e-4bb9-a584-ce9aa5311ccf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前大部分的人才都聚集在体制内，人才不愿意出来，因为现在体制内的待遇和特权越来越多了，比如说退休待遇，双轨制等等。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb305004-e7ac-4a3c-b96d-16687f08349e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"教育领域，民办和公办是两套体系，即使民办愿意给出两倍的工资，公办学校的老师也不愿意到民办学校来，原因之一是这些老师退休高享受的退休待遇比在民办要好很多；公务员的双轨制，不用交社保（现在需要交一点了），但是在退休可以享受几乎和工资差不多的社保待遇。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"67bbb883-226a-45ef-9e14-5972f127560a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些特权限制了人才的流动，中国的创新机制仍然不能完成。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"37b626bb-2ced-4821-8bbf-dd5591a7ff80","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d62a7382-a900-4fb7-9d16-4ab01d556c98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前中国的官僚主义体系盛行"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6dd65030-cb61-4557-a867-3714ac4e59e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学生对自己要跟随的老师没有发言权，一个城市没有资格选择自己的城市领导人。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d79882eb-6993-4d10-9802-85044b5117fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个人都在揣摩上级再想什么，都在为保住自己的饭碗而努力，而不是想着如何为社会做出更多的贡献。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02f90f56-e946-489c-89ec-9bfe1a8da50f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种官僚体系特别容易导致一刀切的现象，上层给出了一个宏观的要求，下层执行时为了不犯错，为了保住自己的饭碗，实行懒政，不考虑百姓具体的需求，实行一刀切的政策。希望政府能精准执政，一刀切的现象越少越好。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d16575aa-75d9-492e-af63-23e4dc043c32","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"48b92fb5-5a11-4b84-885f-f6751c40e272","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"政府需要给民间更多探索的余地"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10680e30-787a-4e8a-8e3d-a8a4fa355f41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"改革开放做对的事情就是允许民间力量去探索，给市场带来了很多的活力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8cada7b-7992-4634-bcd0-c96e0dbaa1d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"建议政府给予民间更多探索的余地，政府只需要明确大方向就行，其余的交给民间去折腾和探索。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8dd3ed51-2ad0-4c11-889f-a18f18466e55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个例子：新东方决定在美国上市，但是国内没有先例，在上市之前，俞敏洪觉得应该得到政府领导的同意，于是拜访了很多的领导，但是都没有得到明确的答复，后来一个领导说，俞敏洪，你也别拜访我了，你去试吧，出事自己承担，不出事算你运气好。这一次的探索给民办教育行业带来了十年的繁荣，政府应当允许更多这样的探索。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0c44271-e1d7-4e3e-8729-f3caf0af6734","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"政府应当允许一段时间的混乱，只要不颠覆社会发展的基础，这种混乱代表其实是一种活力，政府需要更加的大度，在掌控大方向的情况下，允许企业寻找自己突破的道路。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["随笔"],"createTime":1702702471752,"updateTime":1762048351130,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762048351130}}